msgid "<strong>By quantity:</strong> the customer needs to buy a certain quantity to get a discount on one item (the cheapest/most expensive).<br> <strong>Global discount:</strong> the discount applies to <em>all</em> matching products in the cart, regardless of quantity. Perfect for category discounts such as \"15% off all shoes\"."
